        // before the live tail (if it existed). Since we rebuilt render_cells,
        // the last item in new_renderables is the newly added cell (or the last committed cell).
        // render_cells already added the inset to the new cell if it's not the first.
        // If there was a tail, it was appended above.
        // The logic in render_cells: if !c.is_stream_continuation() && i > 0 -> add inset.
        // So the last committed cell (at index self.cells.len() - 1) will have an inset if index > 0.
        // This is correct.
    }

